      "text": "fakenet\n• answers every name with a fake 198.18.x\n• HTTPS: mints a certificate for the\n  name on the fly (our CA is trusted\n  inside the sandbox) and decrypts\n• HTTP / raw TCP: accepts and records\n• replies {} · sends nothing out",
